Package: patterntest
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, tar, rsync, findutils
Description: Pattern matching test tool for command-line utilities
 Pattern Test helps verify how different tools (tar, rsync, find, glob)
 handle pattern matching syntaxes including wildcards, regex, extended
 globs, character sets, and path patterns.
 .
 Features:
  - Test pattern matching for multiple tools
  - Support for various pattern types
  - Multiple output formats (text, HTML, LaTeX, PDF, CSV, Markdown)
  - Detailed test reports with expected vs actual matches

